  "id": "ex-02-possessivpronomen-b1",
  "intro": "Standalone drill set, not tied to any lesson. Two new pieces on top of the A1/A2 sets: (1) the possessive used ON ITS OWN, without a noun (Ist das dein Buch? — Nein, das ist meins) — this declines like dieser, not like ein, so the masculine Nominativ and neuter forms differ from the article you already know (meiner, meins/meines — feminine and plural stay identical to the article: meine). (2) the Genitiv of possession (das Auto meines Vaters), including weak nouns that keep their -n even in the Genitiv (meines Nachbarn, not meines Nachbars). Answers in solutions.md.\n",
  "lesson": "EX/02-possessivpronomen-b1",
